# Source PDFs and other primary texts are not committed.
# They are usually copyrighted and would balloon the repo.
# Drop them into subdirectories per figure (e.g. sources/elon/the-book-of-elon.pdf)
# and Claude reads them locally during ingestion sessions.
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.docx
*.txt

# Text extracted by scripts/pdf-to-md.mjs. This is the book itself in another
# format, so it is exactly as copyrighted as the PDF it came from and must not
# be committed. Only the skills derived from it belong in the repo.
_md/

# Generated test fixture. scripts/make-test-pdf.mjs recreates it on demand, so
# there is nothing to preserve here.
_fixtures/

# Official Berkshire shareholder-letter mirror and searchable extracts.
# The manifest stays tracked; the copyrighted source text stays local.
warren-buffett/berkshire-shareholder-letters/raw/
warren-buffett/berkshire-shareholder-letters/text/

# Allow this folder's own README and gitignore so the directory is not empty
!.gitignore
!README.md
